{"chapter": "Chapter 1", "paragraph_index": 0, "source": "第一章 天降奇缘", "translation": "Chapter One: A Fateful Encounter"}
{"chapter": "Chapter 1", "paragraph_index": 1, "source": "李明抬頭望向天空。", "translation": "Li Ming looked up at the sky."}
{"chapter": "Chapter 1", "paragraph_index": 2, "source": "忽然間，一道光芒劃破夜空。", "translation": "忽然間，一道光芒劃破夜空。"}
{"chapter": "Chapter 1", "paragraph_index": 3, "source": "他驚呼：\"這是什麼？\"", "translation": "He gasped, \"What is this?\""}
{"chapter": "Chapter 1", "paragraph_index": 4, "source": "這就是故事的開始。", "translation": "This was how the story began."}
{"chapter": "Chapter 2", "paragraph_index": 0, "source": "第二章 無聲的告別", "translation": "Chapter Two: A Silent Farewell"}
{"chapter": "Chapter 2", "paragraph_index": 1, "source": "小鎮上的燈火逐漸熄滅。", "translation": "Small town lights slowly dimmed."}
{"chapter": "Chapter 2", "paragraph_index": 2, "source": "他站在橋上，心中充滿不安。", "translation": "He stood on the bridge, heart uneasy."}
{"chapter": "Chapter 2", "paragraph_index": 3, "source": "這段話缺少翻譯。", "translation": ""}
{"chapter": "Chapter 2", "paragraph_index": 4, "source": "月光灑在河面上，映出他的影子。", "translation": "Moonlight spread over the river, outlining his shadow."}
